2 CONC ounty F.  GAR  CIVIL WAR FGW FORD, CAPT. 1833 - 1921
2 CONT HOME 1916 WAS 331 WARDER AVE. GRAFTON, STANDING 5/91, PICTURE TAKEN
2 CONT !SOURCE: Documents include records from family bible, 1917 journal b y F
2 CONC GWF which includes brief description of his life-to-date in possess ion o
