2 CONT
2 CONT GSERVICE.--At New Creek Station October 18-December 22. 1862. Moved t o S
2 CONC ir John's Run December 22, and duty there guarding Baltimore & Ohi o Ra
2 CONC ilroad until June 16, 1863. Moved to New Creek June 16, thence t o Cumb
2 CONC erland, Md., and to Hancock, Md., July 4. To Fairview July 11, a nd to W
2 CONC illiamsport, Md., July 14. Operations against Lee until July 28 . At Me
2 CONC chanicsburg Gap, near Romney, August 5-November 5, and at Alpin e until A
2 CONC pril, 1864. Bath March 19 Crook's Expedition against Virgini a & Tennes
2 CONC see Railroad May 2-19. Battle of Cloyd's Mountain May 9. Ne w River Bri
2 CONC dge May 10. Cove Mountain or Grassy Lick, near Wytheville , May 10. Sal
2 CONC t Pond Mountain and Gap Mountain May 12-13. Meadow Bluf f May 19. Hunte
2 CONC r's Expedition to Lynchburg May 26-July 1. Middlebroo k and Brownsville J
2 CONC une 10. Lexington June 11-12. Otter Creek, near Lib erty, June 16. Diam
2 CONC ond Hill June 17. Lynchburg June 17-18. Retreat t o Charleston June 18-
2 CONC July 1. Buford's Gap June 20. About Salem June 21 . Moved to Shenandoah V
2 CONC alley July 12-15. Snicker's Ferry or Gap July 1 7-18. Battle of Kernsto
2 CONC wn-Winchester July 23-24. Sheridan's Shenandoa h Valley Campaign August 6
2 CONC -November 28. Berryville September 3. Battl e of Opequan, Winchester, S
2 CONC eptember 19. Fisher's Hill September 22. Sk irmish at Cedar Creek Octob
2 CONC er 13. Battle of Cedar Creek October 19. Du ty at Camp Russell and in t
2 CONC he Shenandoah Valley until December. Move d to Washington, D.C., thence t
2 CONC o Bermuda Hundred, Va., December 19-23 . Duty in the trenches before Ri
2 CONC chmond, Va., until March, 1865. Appoma ttox Campaign March 28-April 9. M
2 CONC oved to front of Petersburg March 28- 29. Hatcher's Run March 30-31 and A
2 CONC pril 1. Fall of Petersburg April 2 . Pursuit of Lee April 3-9. Rice's S
2 CONC tation April 6. Appomattox Court H ouse April 9. Surrender of Lee and h
2 CONC is army. March to Lynchburg Apri l 12-15, thence to Farmville and Burke
2 CONC sville Junction April 15-19, an d to Richmond, Va., April 22-25. Duty n
2 CONC ear Richmond until June. Muster ed out June 14, 1865.
