2 CONT BIRTH:  Some show Otto's wife (Hedwig) as dau. (illeg.) of Arnulf, Kin g o
2 CONC f Germany, Emp. abt. 863-99, & Oda of Bavaria; Arnulf was son of Ca rlo
2 CONC man, King of Bavaria (abt 828-80) & Litwinde; Carloman was son of L oui
2 CONC s II "the German", King of the East Franks (abt. 805-76) and Emma o f B
2 CONC avaria.  Louis was son of Louis I 'the fair".  Others shows Hedwi g as d
2 CONC au. of Henrich, d. 886, Markgraf of the Netherlands.  OR Hedwi g as dau
2 CONC . of Henri, Comte de la Marche.  UNSURE PARENTAGE
