2 CONC ary Lavina Mann, b. Butte City, CA.  Supporting evidence:  Aff. Ev a A. T
2 CONC ull, aunt, Jan. 23, 1968; Belva A. Haynes, aunt, Jan. 23, 1958 ; Marr. C
2 CONC ert. August 12, 1925.  Filed February 28, 1968, No. 150793, p g. 199.
2 CONT
