2 CONC r. Edward County, who died in 1850 leaving one son Merrit Allen Sau nde
2 CONC rs.  kHe then married Mary E. Withers, daughter of Dr. Robert W. Wi the
2 CONC rs of "Rock Castle" in Campbells County, Virginia. and she has seve n c
2 CONC hildren:  Sallie B., Susan D., Janet A., Robert G., Frank T., Walte r A
2 CONC . and Howard Chinn Saunders, all of whom are now living."
