2 CONT !SOURCE:  WITH SAUNDERS PAPERS IN VIRGINIA STATE LIB.:  Dr. E. Peterfi e
2 CONC ld Trent - medical
2 CONT journal (1850-1856)  These are his accounts receivable  - the listing s o
2 CONC f Buckingham visits made to ailing residents, the charge, amounts p aid a
2 CONC nd owing.
2 CONT Also inclues items of his opn personal dealings and some of his estat e a
2 CONC s this is apparently his last journal before death and was in his l awy
2 CONC ers (Geo. D. Saunders) possession.
2 CONT
2 CONT !SOURCE:  "The Courthouse Burned, II" pg169:  In 1854 Dr. Edwin P. Tre n
