2 CONT A physician who graduated from the University of Virginia. Col. Wither s s
2 CONC erved in the 18th Virginia Infantry, C.S.A.. After the Civil War, h e e
2 CONC stablished the Lynchburg News in 1866. He served as Lt. Governor o f Vi
2 CONC rginia from 1873-1875, United States Senator from Virginia from 18 75-1
2 CONC 881, and United States Consul to Hong Kong from 1885 to 1889. Fo r more i
2 CONC nformation about Col. Withers, see his biography in the Biogra phical D
2 CONC irectory of the United States Congress
