1 NOTE  Robert Alexander was born at "Manor Cunningham" Londonderry, Ireland i n 1
2 CONC 719. His wife was Esther Beard of Pennsylvania. Robert Alexander wa s e
2 CONC ducated at the Universities of Dublin and Edinburg and was bringin g hi
2 CONC s library to America but owing to a storm at sea he was obliged t o thr
2 CONC ow it overboard, however, he was so will versed in classics tha t he wr
2 CONC ote many of them out in long hand from memory an taught from th ere unt
2 CONC il he could obtain others. The first classical school to be tau ght wes
2 CONC t of the Alleghany mountains was started by Robert Alexander. I t was f
2 CONC irst started as a private school near Lexington, Virginia. in 1 749. La
2 CONC ter it was enlarged and called Liberty Hall Academy. From tha t small b
2 CONC eginning has come Washington and Lee University.
