2 CONC 797, divided land between William Winston and Sarah, his wife, an d Pet
2 CONC er Hales, orphan of Peter Hales." Land adjoins lands of Samuel Sa under
2 CONC s, her father.  Issue:  Peter Hales and probably two Winston chil dren.
