2 CONT The following information was taken from Mrs. Burnie O. Murphy's
2 CONT Obituary-----Anna was employed at Biggie's Drive-In in Grafton for 23
2 CONT years.  She attended the Parkview Church of the Nazarene and was a
2 CONT member of the Victory Bible class.  Surviving or one son, Thomas Loye
2 CONT Murphy, Proctor; one daughter, Mrs. George (Dottie) Shelton, Grafton,
2 CONT and 11 grandchildren and 12 great-grandchildren.  She was also precede d
2 CONT in death by two sons, David Deahl Murphy and Otis Max Murphy; two
2 CONT brothers, Ralph Plum and Harry Plum, and four sisters, Mrs. Earl G.
2 CONT (Hazel) Murphy, Nina, who died in infancy, Mrs, John (Dorothy) Ford,
2 CONT and Miss Joyce Corrick.
