1 NOTE  !REL: Imperfect History of Saunders Family, and family tree;
2 CONT
2 CONT Per History: "John removed to Shelby County, Ky. and left a large fami l
2 CONC y some of whom are in Shelbyville and Shelby County  Others went to M i
2 CONC ssouri."
2 CONT
2 CONT Problem 1 - Ky. descendent of John sent me (JWS) this:
2 CONT John Saunders b. 1776 Buck.County  d. 1809 Ky.
2 CONT m. Judith Fore, Pr. Ed. County
2 CONT Issue:  Dr. Thomas Saunders/Sanders(1800-1833)
2 CONT m. Jane Hardin (1807-1882)
2 CONT Issue: Dr. Thomas Sanders (1832-1904)
2 CONT m. Mary Louise Stuart 1849-1903
2 CONT
2 CONT DAR  John Saunders b. 1759 m. Judith Fore
2 CONT
2 CONT Problem 2 - Saunders Graveyard, Barren County Ky:
2 CONT Martha Curd, wife of John Saunders, b.1788 d. 1851
2 CONT John Saunders b.1773, d.1837
2 CONT
2 CONT The Curd Family comes from Buckingham County Virginia, near area Curds v
2 CONC ille.  All Curds migrated to Tennessee except Edward Curd who lived n e
2 CONC xt to John Saunders in 1810.  Curds have known Saunders' connection t h
2 CONC ru Capt. John Saunders of Buckingham County
