2 CONT Thomas Stanley, KG (1457); 1st Lord (Baron) Stanley, so created by wri t o
2 CONC f summons to Parliament 15 Jan 1455/6, and although this Barony, to get
2 CONC her is that of Strange has passed to another family, yet descendant s o
2 CONC f both sexes of the grantee are in remainder to it according to th e la
2 CONC ter doctrine as to heritability of baronies by writ of summons; kn ight
2 CONC ed c1431, Lt of Ireland 1432-36, Constable of Chester Castle, Cont roll
2 CONC er of Royal Household and Chamberlain of North Wales 1439, Justic e of C
2 CONC hester, Flintshire, and North Wales 1443, Cheif Steward of Duch y of La
2 CONC ncaster 1448, Warden of Calais.  [Burke's Peerage]
