1 NOTE  Elizabeth Fitzalan D'ARUNDELLE - Elizabeth was daughter of Richard, Ea r
2 CONC lof Arundel and sister of Thomas, also Earl of Arundel, of whom she w a
2 CONC sco-heir. Her first husband was William de Montacute, and she married T
2 CONC homas Mowbray as his second wife in 1385. She married the third tim e t
2 CONC oRobert Goudhill, Esq, without the King's license, and her dower la nds
2 CONC were ordered back into the king's hands. She was pardoned and her l and
2 CONC swere restored. He was knighted and received control of her dower l and
2 CONC ."
