1 NOTE  John became Sheriff of both Essex and Hertford in 1403 after moving to h
2 CONC is wife Margaret's manor in Essex. John also server as Sheriff onseve r
2 CONC al occasions in later years. After Margaret's death in 1383, Johnmarr i
2 CONC ed Alice Tendring who brought additional wealth to the Howard fold.Jo h
2 CONC n held the office of Admiral of The Northern Seas, and he sat duringo n
2 CONC e Parliament as Knight of the shire for Cambridge, through the Paizin f
2 CONC luence. In 1436 John went on a pilgrimage to the Holy Land and died a t
2 CONC Jerusalem in 1437.
