2 CONC fis that of Richard FitzAlan, 9th Earl of Arundel and his first wif eIs
2 CONC abel le Despenser. They were married as children and had at least t wok
2 CONC ids: Edmund FitzAlan and Isabel FitzAlan; however at a later date,R ich
2 CONC ard FitzAlan decided that he would much rather be married to Eleano r,t
2 CONC he daughter of the Earl of Lancaster, so he claimed that he was too you
2 CONC ng to actually consent to the marriage and that for that reason the mar
2 CONC riage was annulled. The pope apparently agreed with the reason an d the
2 CONC marriage was annulled and Edmund and Isabel FitzAlan were declare dille
2 CONC gitimate and the 10th Earl of Arundel was the eldest son from the secon
2 CONC d marriage.
