1 NOTE  MISC:  The mother of Rohesia was Adela, daughter and coheir of Sir Rob e
2 CONC rt CORBET, Lord of Alcester in Warwickshire, by King Henry I., by who m s
2 CONC he was also mother of Reginald, Earl of Cornwall.  the latter, wh o obt
2 CONC ain the earldom of Moreton from King Stephen, and died 21 Henry I I., b
2 CONC y a deep still preserved amoung the muniments of Viscount Falmout h at T
2 CONC regothnan (Tregony) in Cornwall, gave to his sister, Rohesia d e Pomeri
2 CONC a, his manor of Riduri in that county in free marriage."
