2 CONT Maud de Abrincis m. 1st, --- Deincourt, by whom she had a dau., Hawise , m
2 CONC . to Sir Reginald de Courtenay. Maud m. 2ndly, Robert FitzEdith, na tur
2 CONC al son of King Henry I, and had another dau., Matilda, m. to Willia m d
2 CONC e Courtenay, brother of Sir Reginald. [Sir Bernard Burke, Dormant a nd E
2 CONC xtinct Peerages, Burke's Peerage, London, 1883, p. 140, Courtenay , Bar
2 CONC ons Courtenay, Earls of Devon]
2 CONT
2 CONT Note Burke's newest Peerage (1999 - not extinct) has a different stor y t
2 CONC o tell.  Maud (Matilda) married Reginald (Renaud) and Hawise marrie d t
2 CONC he son (also name Reginald or Renaud).  No mention is made of who m arr
2 CONC ied Renaud I's brother William.  Plus Maud de Abrincis is named "Ma ud D
2 CONC 'Avranches".  Plus Hawise is dau of de Coucy - not Deincourt.  (no te - P
2 CONC lantagenet ancestry also has Deincourt.  I have Hawise Deincour t as Re
2 CONC ginald, the father's 1st wife.).  I am going with the newest Bu rke (19
2 CONC 99).
