2 CONC risis arose over the succession to the Fre nch throne. The Duke gave hi
2 CONC s support to Henry I against the party fav ouring his younger brother; i
2 CONC n reward for his services he demanded an d received the Vexin Franais, a t
2 CONC erritory not far north of Paris. A pa tron of the monastic reform movem
