2 CONC 3 and married Hamelin in 1164.Don't know how to resolve that , but will m
2 CONC ake her born in 1165. Ancestral Roots, line 30, says thi s woman may ha
2 CONC ve been Alix de Porhoet. Sureties: Ida.
