2 CONT She became mistress of John of Gaunt abt. 1371.  Made Lady of the Gart e
2 CONC r in  1388.  All children born before she married John of Gaunt, bu t w
2 CONC ere legitimated by Pope on Sept. 1, 1396, and also by Charter of Ri cha
2 CONC rd II on Feb. 9, 1397, but this charter excluded them from successi on t
2 CONC o the English throne.
2 CONT
2 CONT [Carelton-Stickney.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Her four children were born before marriage, legitimized by and Act
2 CONT of Parliament, February 1397, and by the Pope. They took the name of
2 CONT Beaufort from their father's lost Lordship in Champagne.
2 CONT
