2 CONC urope,Charlemagne restored much o f the unity of the old Roman Empirean
2 CONC d paved the way for the developme nt of modern Europe.Crowned EmperorOn C
2 CONC hristmas Day in 800, while Char lemagne knelt in prayer inSt. Peter's i
2 CONC n Rome, Pope Leo III seized a g olden crown from thealtar and placed it o
2 CONC n the bowed head of the king . The throng inthe church shouted, "To Cha
