2 CONC f King Henry I. She wa s born in 1101, generally it is said at Winchest
2 CONC er, but recent researc h indicates that she was actually born at the Ro
2 CONC yal Palace in Sutton C ourtenay (Berkshire).In something of a political c
2 CONC oup for her father , Matilda was betrothed to the German Emperor, Henry V
2 CONC , when she was o nly eight. They were married on 7th January 1114. She w
2 CONC as twelve and h e was thirty-two. Unfortunately there were no children a
