2 CONC reed that Henry should suc ceed him; he was crowned Henry II of England i
2 CONC n 1154. She spent the re mainder of her life in Normandie watching over H
2 CONC enry II's continenta l holdings.-------------------Matilda (Maud) was b
2 CONC orn before 5 Aug 110 2 in London, Middlesex County, England. She died i
2 CONC n 1167 in Notre Dame , Rouen, Normandy, France. She has Ancestral File n
