1 NOTE  DIFFERENT SOURCES GIVE FOUR DIFFERENT NAMES FOR ROGNVALD'S  FATHER.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOME SOURCES SAY ROGNVALD'S FATHER  WAS HARALD KING OF JUTLAND & VESTF O
2 CONC L (L) FAIRHAIR.
2 CONT
2 CONT OTHER POSSIBLE PARENTS ARE SHOWN BELOW BUT THIS INDIVIDUAL IS NOT SHOW N A
2 CONC S A CHILD ON THE FOLLOWING POSSIBLE PARENTS' FAMILY PAGES FOR TO D O SO W
2 CONC OULD BE  CONSIDERED ERRORS BY THIS PROGRAM.  EVEN THOUGH THESE L AST PO
2 CONC SSIBLE PARENTS MAY BE THE CORRECT ONES, SHOWING MORE THAN ONE SE T OF P
2 CONC ARENTS COULD CAUSE MY "FAMILY TREE" PROGRAM TO MALFUNCTION.
2 CONT
2 CONT OTHER SOURCES SAY ROGNVALD'S FATHER  WAS OLAF II (NOTES) "GEIRSTADA-AL F
2 CONC " (L) GUDRODSSON.
2 CONT
2 CONT STILL OTHER SOURCES SAY IT WAS EYSTEIN (NOTES) "THE CHATTERER" "GLUMRA " (
2 CONC L) IVARSSON
2 CONT
2 CONT AND YET OTHER SOURCES SAY HIS FATHER  WAS HALFDAN II (NOTES) (L) EYSTE I
2 CONC NSSON AND HIS MOTHER WAS HILF OR LIV (NOTES) DAGSDATTER OR (L)  DAGSD O
2 CONC TTIR.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALSO, VARIOUS SOURCES SHOW HIS WIFE RAGNHILD (SEE NOTES) GROA OF  (L ) T
2 CONC RONDHEIM  WITH TWO DIFFERENT HUSBANDS WITH VERY SIMILAR NAMES,
2 CONT
2 CONT THE TWO SUPPOSEDLY DIFFERENT HUSBANDS OF RAGNHILD ARE ROGNVALD I (SE E N
2 CONC OTES) EYSTEINSSON (L) OLAFSSON AND ROGNVALD II (SEE NOTES) "THE WIS E"  (
2 CONC L)  EYSTEINSSON.
2 CONT
2 CONT THIS SEEMS HIGHLY UNLIKELY TO BE TRUE AND THAT THEY ARE EITHER ONE PER S
2 CONC ON OR ONE OR THE OTHER NAME IS AT LEAST PARTIALLY WRONG,
2 CONT
2 CONT AS THE TWO MEN SHOW DIFFERENT PARENTS AND CHILDREN, AS I HAVE NO OTHE R N
2 CONC AMES FOR EITHER OF THEM AND AS I SHOW THEM DISTANTLY RELATED AND CA N'T M
2 CONC ERGE THEM ON THIS PROGRAM, I HAVE SHOWN HER WITH BOTH OF THESE SI MILAR
2 CONC LY NAMED HUSBANDS,
