2 CONC &id=I122752
2 CONT
2 CONT VARIOUS SOURCES SAY THAT OSBERN I (SEE NOTES) DE BOLEBEC OR DE BOLBEC> >  H
2 CONC AD TWO  SISTERS AS WIVES .  SOME SOURCES SAY ONE, SOME THE OTHER , SOME B
2 CONC OTH,
2 CONT
2 CONT THE SISTERS HAD VERY SIMILAR NAMES AND I HAVE MERGED THEM HERE TO SHO W J
2 CONC UST ONE.
2 CONT
2 CONT IF, INSTEAD AS WHAT I SHOW . THERE  WERE INDEEDTWO  DIFFERENTWIVES AN D S
2 CONC ISTERS, THEIR NAMES WERE AVELINA (SEE NOTES) WEVIA DE CREPON>> AN D WEV
2 CONC IE OR EVA OR SENFRIE (SEE NOTES) DE CREPON>>.
2 CONT
2 CONT SOME SOURCES SAY AVELINA AND  WEVIE'S (IF THEY WERE INDEED TWO PERSONS )  F
2 CONC ATHER WAS HERBASTUS OR HERFASTUS DE ARQUE DE CREPON>> AND HER MOTH ER W
2 CONC AS  GUNHILD OR GUNHILDA OLAFSDOTTIR OF DENMARK>>.
2 CONT
2 CONT OTHER SOURCES SAY HER I (SEE NOTES) GORMSSON KING DENMARK>> ANOTHER O F H
2 CONC ER MOTHER'S HUSBANDS.SOME  SOURCES  SAY  THAT AVALINA'S HUSBAND WA S TH
2 CONC E OSBORNE DE BOLEBEC>> BORN ABOUT 945.
2 CONT
2 CONT OTHER SOURCES  SAY  THAT AVALINA'S HUSBAND WAS THE SON OF THAT EARLIE R O
2 CONC SBERN AND WAS THE OSBERN I SEIGNEUR OF LONGUEVILLE DE BOLBEC>> BOR N AB
2 CONC OUT 975.
2 CONT
2 CONT TO FURTHER COMPLICATE IT, SOME  SOURCES SAY THAT ANOTHER WIFE OF THE Y O
2 CONC UNGER OSBERN WAS A SISTER OF AVELINA AND HAD A VERY SIMILAR NAME,  I F S
2 CONC HE WAS INDEED A SECOND WIFE AND A DIFFERENT PERSON, HER NAME WAS WE VIE O
2 CONC R EVA OR SENFRIE (SEE NOTES) DE CREPON>>.
2 CONT
2 CONT ALSO, AS WITH HER SISTER, SOME SOURCES SAY AVELINA AND  WEVIE'S (IF TH E
2 CONC Y WERE TWO PERSONS)  FATHER WAS HERBASTUS OR HERFASTUS DE ARQUE DE CR E
2 CONC PON>> AND HER MOTHER WAS  GUNHILD OR GUNHILDA OLAFSDOTTIR OF DENMARK> >
2 CONC .
2 CONT
2 CONT WHILE OTHER SOURCES SAY HER ( THIER) FATHER WAS HARALD II (SEE NOTES ) G
2 CONC ORMSSON KING DENMARK>> ANOTHER OF HER MOTHER'S HUSBANDS.
2 CONT
2 CONT WHILE STILL OTHER SOURCES SAY HER MOTHER WAS GYNRITHE OR GUNHILDA OR C Y
2 CONC RID OLAFSDOTTER>>  ANOTHER OF HER FATHER (&#00063;) HARALD II'S WIVE S A
2 CONC ND A SISTER &#00063; (WITH A VERY SIMILAR NAME) TO GUNHILD OR GUNHI LDA O
2 CONC LAFSDOTTIR OF DENMARK>> (THIS LAST TWO POSSIBLE MOTHERS MAY BE JU ST ON
2 CONC E PERSON0
2 CONT
2 CONT NEEDLESS TO SAY, IT'S ALL VERY CONFUSING AND THERE ARE SURE TO BE ERRO R
2 CONC S HERE.
2 CONT
2 CONT BUT, WHAT'S RIGHT&#00063;
