1 NOTE  William de Warenne (Warren) was the second husband of Isabel de Verman d
2 CONC ois.  He was the second Earl of Warren and Surrey.  For participatin g i
2 CONC n an invitation for Duke Robert of Normandy to invade England, Will iam w
2 CONC as deprived of his estates by Henry I.  Several years later the r ift b
2 CONC etween the King and William was repaired and Henry returned the e state
2 CONC s to William.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: RC 39, 135, 143; A. Roots 50, 83; Kraentzler 1265, 1146,1333 , 1
2 CONC 415; AF; Smallwood;
