2 CONT William de Braose, Third Lord of Bramber (d. ca. 1180) was the eldes t s
2 CONC on of Philip de Braose, Second Lord of Bramber. William married Ber tha d
2 CONC e Pitres, daughter of Miles of Gloucester, Earl of Hereford. Thro ugh t
2 CONC his marriage, William acquired lordship of Brecon and Abergavenn y in 1
2 CONC 166 because Bertha's brothers all died young without heirs.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1174, William became sheriff of Hereford. He was succeeded as Lor d o
2 CONC f Bramber by his son, William.
